<title>UK: DSL sets $150 million six-year bond.</title>
<headline>DSL sets $150 million six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL BANK DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     6.5	 MATURITY    11.JUL.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.22    PAY DATE    11.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.62     SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> IBCA	 AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMAN    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.6	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
